WEBVTT

00:45.744 --> 00:52.886
A song I've never heard before Just kicked down a

00:53.066 --> 01:02.748
forgotten door A tidal wave of pure relief

01:02.948 --> 01:09.190
Moments break from all the grief You're by my

01:09.250 --> 01:09.790
side

01:14.410 --> 01:21.416
In this strange and foreign land But underneath

01:21.677 --> 01:28.703
the happy tears Are all the ghosts of these long

01:28.783 --> 01:29.804
years

01:33.582 --> 01:37.444
I'm trying to find my way back home Through the

01:37.484 --> 01:42.307
static and the chrome The 80s beat is in my soul

01:42.827 --> 01:48.850
But the darkness still has its control A song of

01:48.910 --> 01:53.013
home coming in my head For all the words I haven't

01:53.053 --> 01:59.416
said I'm trying to get back to the light With all

01:59.576 --> 02:02.097
of my remaining might

02:09.743 --> 02:10.544
I

02:13.106 --> 02:19.350
see the plains outside the glass And pray this

02:19.530 --> 02:25.395
fragile feeling's built to last Your quiet

02:25.435 --> 02:32.846
strength, your gentle grace The only safety in

02:32.966 --> 02:42.068
this place But every echo, every sound On this

02:42.308 --> 02:50.491
unholy, hollow ground Pulls me back to that dark

02:50.631 --> 02:56.892
room And the silence of a living tomb

03:01.277 --> 03:04.978
I'm trying to find my way back home Through the

03:05.018 --> 03:09.879
static and the chrome The 80s beat is in my soul

03:10.359 --> 03:16.340
But the darkness still has its control A song of

03:16.400 --> 03:20.541
home coming in my head For all the words I haven't

03:20.601 --> 03:26.942
said I'm trying to get back to the light With all

03:27.102 --> 03:31.724
of my remaining might So,

04:02.261 --> 04:02.281
♪

04:28.166 --> 04:31.206
All's calm All's free

05:00.485 --> 05:00.692
Me.

